{{Basis}}

This is a list of living [[Qymish royal family]] members who, through royal descent or marriage, currently hold the rank of Prince or Princess of Qym. There are currently 24 living princes and princesses by birthright, and 7 women who are princesses by marriage. 

[[Mirmo ish Zhifol]], who is alive at {{abbr|32|27 (Earth Age Equivalent)}}, was a prince from {{abbr|2408|2000 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} until {{abbr|2433|2021 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, when he abdicated his royal privileges and titles. 

